% `sort alreadySigned` is outside the subset
% RESIDUE pending_finalize END

% Daml (the script run on a Canton sandbox) ends with these active contracts (their payloads;
% the ids are the ledger's):
%   - agreement([alice,bob,clare,dave])
% The twin's final state under LPS2 (`lps state`) is compared with it by test_daml.pl.
scenario multiple_party_agreement_test is:
    % the Daml Script multiplePartyAgreementTest
    % Daml refuses the next command (submitMustFail): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    alice creates the pending initial_fail_test with final contract signatories party list [alice, bob, clare, dave] and already signed party list [alice, bob] from 1 to 2.
    alice creates the pending pending with final contract signatories party list [alice, bob, clare, dave] and already signed party list [alice] from 2 to 3.

